     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts FRHealthProfessionalLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"FRHealthProfessionalLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"hcFRHealthProfessionalLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Groupe 1 </b>Mapping de <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-health-professional</code> to <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-cda-assigned-entity</code></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMHealthProfessional</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>assignedEntity</td><td>assignedEntity et assignedAuthor (porté par ClinicalDocument.author) partagent une structure CDA équivalente pour représenter un professionnel de santé.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMHealthProfessional.identifier</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>assignedEntity.id</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMHealthProfessional.name</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>assignedEntity.assignedPerson.name</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMHealthProfessional.name.family</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>assignedEntity.assignedPerson.name.family</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMHealthProfessional.name.given</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>assignedEntity.assignedPerson.name.given</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMHealthProfessional.name.prefix</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>assignedEntity.assignedPerson.name.prefix</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMHealthProfessional.name.suffix</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>assignedEntity.assignedPerson.name.suffix</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMHealthProfessional.address</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>assignedEntity.addr</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMHealthProfessional.telecom</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>assignedEntity.telecom</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMHealthProfessional.professionalRole.role</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>assignedEntity.code</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMHealthProfessional.professionalRole.organisation</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>assignedEntity.representedOrganization</td><td>Cf. FROrganisationLMCDAFHIR pour le détail du mapping de la structure d'exercice.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMHealthProfessional.professionalRole.specialty</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucun champ CDA dédié à la spécialité ; elle est portée par assignedEntity.code selon le contexte.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Groupe 2 </b>Mapping de <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-health-professional</code> to <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-practitionerRole-document</code></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMHealthProfessional</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>PractitionerRole</td><td>PractitionerRole ne porte que le rôle d'exercice ; l'identité de la personne (identifiant, nom, adresse, télécom) est portée par PractitionerRole.practitioner, cf. le groupe de mapping suivant vers FrPractitionerDocument.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMHealthProfessional.professionalRole.role</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>PractitionerRole.code</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMHealthProfessional.professionalRole.organisation</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>PractitionerRole.organization</td><td>PractitionerRole.organization.resolve().ofType(Organization) — cf. FROrganisationLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMHealthProfessional.professionalRole.specialty</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>PractitionerRole.specialty</td><td/></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Groupe 3 </b>Mapping de <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-health-professional</code> to <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-practitioner-document</code></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMHealthProfessional</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" ti